# Prismari, the Inspiration: "Instant and sorcery spells you cast have storm." (CR 702.40a) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus,
# Mox Sapphire, Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and a Mountain pay {5}{U}{R}). On turn 3 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1 in the upkeep (not a
# storm spell: Prismari gives it only to its controller's spells) and Bot1 then casts two Bolts at Bot2. The first has one spell
# before it (Bot2's), so it is copied once: 3 + 3 = 6. The second has two before it (Bot2's Bolt and the first), so it is copied
# twice, not four times - the copy of a spell is not cast, so it is not counted (CR 707.10): 3 + 3 + 3 = 9. Bot2 is left on 20 - 15 = 5
# and Bot1 on 17.

